      },
      {
        "stage": 15.5,
        "statement": "A couple structures threatened in downtown Batavia. IL-25 (East River Road) is threatened near Boulder Hill Pass. Numerous sections of Fox River Trail are threatened in Oswego. Low-lying trails threatened at Lippold Park between Batavia and North Aurora. Athletic fields at South River Street Park are inundated in Aurora."
      },
      {
        "stage": 15,
        "statement": "Residences are threatened along River Street near Ashland Avenue in Montgomery. Veterans Memorial threatened at Illinois Avenue in Aurora. Low-lying sections of Hudson Crossing Park are inundated in Oswego."
      },
      {
        "stage": 14.5,
        "statement": "Athletic fields threatened at Clark Island Park in Batavia."
      },
      {
        "stage": 14,
        "statement": "Low-lying park land inundated along IL-25 between Montomgery and Oswego. Low-lying sections of Fabyan Forest Preserve near Batavia, Hurds Island and Gregory Island Park in Aurora, and Riverfront Park in North Aurora are inundated."
      },
      {
        "stage": 13.5,
        "statement": "Low-lying parking lots at city hall and Boy Scout Island are threatened in St. Charles. Fox River Trail is threatened at St. Mary Park in St. Charles."
      },
      {
